          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વસાવવું (vasāvvũ) is the causative partner of વસવું, to settle, a tadbhava of Sanskrit vasati, \"dwells\" (CDIAL 11435): to make people or a home settle in a place."
